:"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-06T21:26:35-07:00","id":983136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/982060-ordo-dracul-wyrm-nest-s-in-the-hedge?p=983002#post983002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its said in the Hedge section that Vampires don't need to feed in the Hedge</div> </div> </div> </div>It says that they might relish the idea of a world where time doesn't pass and thus their hunger doesn't proc. Not the same thing, especially given the writeup also specifies by the quality's inclusion in a list of other differentials that &quot;some places have no time at all&quot; is not a uniform state.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T02:26:47-07:00","id":983225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/982060-ordo-dracul-wyrm-nest-s-in-the-hedge?p=983136#post983136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It says that they might relish the idea of a world where time doesn't pass and thus their hunger doesn't proc. Not the same thing, especially given the writeup also specifies by the quality's inclusion in a list of other differentials that &amp;quot;some places have no time at all&amp;quot; is not a uniform state.</div> </div> </div> </div> If there is going to be a place in the hedge adapted to a Vampire's needs, its going to be a Wyrm's Nest Hollow.<br /> <br /> I picture such a Hollow as a massive gothic castle, with thorn covered ivy growing on the walls and storm clouds always above it.<br /> <br /> Inside is a mix of lavish guest chambers, a throne room, a ballroom, and a dining room for guests.<br /> <br /> Deeper in via secret passages you find things like dungeons with every sort of torture device imagible, strange alchemic labs for experiments on the hedge, a kennel for Hedge warpered abominations, a room with still beating hearts fused into the rock walls, quarters for the Vampires terrorified hob servants, a Shadow Garden in the court yard, and rooms filled with the strange luxuries found in the Hedge.<br /> <br /> And former &quot;guests&quot; would have imprinted their horror at a variety of atrostities on various rooms, like echoes of past sins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T03:26:40-07:00","id":983839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/982060-ordo-dracul-wyrm-nest-s-in-the-hedge?p=983225#post983225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If there is going to be a place in the hedge adapted to a Vampire's needs, its going to be a Wyrm's Nest Hollow.<br /> <br /> I picture such a Hollow as a massive gothic castle, with thorn covered ivy growing on the walls and storm clouds always above it.<br /> <br /> Inside is a mix of lavish guest chambers, a throne room, a ballroom, and a dining room for guests.<br /> <br /> Deeper in via secret passages you find things like dungeons with every sort of torture device imagible, strange alchemic labs for experiments on the hedge, a kennel for Hedge warpered abominations, a room with still beating hearts fused into the rock walls, quarters for the Vampires terrorified hob servants, a Shadow Garden in the court yard, and rooms filled with the strange luxuries found in the Hedge.<br /> <br /> And former &quot;guests&quot; would have imprinted their horror at a variety of atrostities on various rooms, like echoes of past sins.</div> </div> </div> </div>With an entrance looking like this, perhaps?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/t64hF\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/t64hF\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/t64hF\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/a/t64hF </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T09:10:10-07:00","id":983942,"title":"","content":"Yep, that will work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}